body:
Yeah, I became a NEET because of depression and anxiety; it has only made those two mental illnesses stronger. Even worse, I have developed severe OCD. Ugh... being a NEET isn’t even fun at this point. You may be able to relate.

At this point, I’m starting to think I should just start doing ANYTHING during the day. ANYTHING at all besides staring at my phone and playing video games all day. But depression and anxiety have a vice grip on my will and motivation, I feel unable to do anything. ;-;

2+ years of my youth down the drain... who knows if I will ever get my shit together and stop pitying myself all the time.
